<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $65 (FIM 311.90).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $65 (FIM 311.90).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-1/4 at $65 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 311.90 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed flat at 307.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-1/8 at $34-1/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 82.20 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 2.00 markka at 82.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Friday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 0.90 markka at 96.10 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
